  "id": "crustless-spinach-mushroom-tomato-quiche",
  "name": "Crustless Spinach, Mushroom & Tomato Quiche",
  "subtitle": "A savory vegetable quiche with a creamy Gouda custard",
  "description": "This crustless quiche combines sautéed vegetables, seasoned cream and eggs, and shredded Gouda in an easy baked breakfast dish.",
  "meal_type": "breakfast",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "yield": {
